This license covers the source in this repository. It does not and cannot
relicense the datasets OXBOW analyses, which keep their own terms and are not
redistributed here:

  - PaySim (synthetic financial transactions)  --  CC BY-SA 4.0
  - IBM Transactional Data Set (AML)           --  CDLA-Sharing-1.0
  - Elliptic Crypto Graph Benchmark            --  CC BY-NC-ND 4.0
        cited as related work only; never acquired, never ingested, never
        used to derive a feature, score, threshold or figure in this project.
  - IEEE-CIS Fraud Detection                   --  not used.

Any derived dataset published from PaySim or IBM data carries the same terms
with attribution, per config/sources.yaml `license_obligation` for each source.
See README.md ("Licence obligations on derived data") and data/DATASET_CARD.md
for the hashes, retrieval dates and measurement provenance of what was used.
